# ── VISRONIX website environment ─────────────────────────────
# All VITE_* values are public (they are compiled into the bundle).
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. Never put secrets here.

# Business email. Defaults to visronix@gmail.com in src/config/site.ts —
# only set this to override it (an empty value restores the "coming soon"
# honest state).
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=

# Production URL, once deployed (e.g. https://visronix.vercel.app or the
# custom domain). Used for canonical URLs, Open Graph metadata and the
# generated sitemap/robots files. Leave unset until the domain is final.
# VITE_SITE_URL=
